X: 1
T: O Lord, When Condemnation
T: (also known as O Lord, When My Sins Grieve Me or When Guilt and Shame Are Raising
T: or When O'er My Sins and Sorrow or When Sorrow and Remorse)
C: Words: Justus Gesenius, 1646. Translated by William Mercer, 1857.
C: Music: 'Wenn Mein Sünd' Michael Praetorius, 1609.  Setting: "Mehrstimmiges Choralbuch", 1906.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2026 Revision.
S: Music source: "Mehrstimmiges Choralbuch", 1906 Hymn 177 (page 140)
S: Lyrics source: "The Lutheran Hymnary", 1913 Hymn 281
M: 6/4 % time signature
L: 1/4 % default length
